### coordinator-api migration gate bounds (4fe54ff5b)

Two limits on the ExecStartPre migration gate: StartLimitIntervalSec=600 +
StartLimitBurst=3 so a failing migration leaves the unit `failed` after
three attempts in ten minutes instead of retry-looping forever (each
attempt ~15s never tripped the default 5/10s burst), and
TimeoutStartSec=600 so a large-table migration isn't killed at the 90s
default mid-write — an actual hazard on SQLite. Verified on node2 via
systemctl show; all three API nodes daemon-reloaded.

